@format 1
@id queue.toggle-automatic
@title Toggle automatic execution
@area 4. Queue and scheduling
@entry input
@summary Enable or disable automatic execution for the active station and persist the preference.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related processing.start, processing.stop

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias preference = Cadroue.UIShell.LPreference

[input] Automatic checkbox changes <input>
- Receive the automatic-execution checkbox state @ console.PConsoleAutoHandle(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply station state <process>
- Set automatic execution on the active station @ console.PConsoleAutoHandle(...)
- Persist the automatic-execution preference @ preference.LPreferenceAutoSet(...)
- Refresh console status and controls @ console.PConsoleProgressUpdate(...)
> result

[result] Automatic execution changed <output>
= The active station and saved preference use the requested automatic state.
